data/processed/*
# The paper-trading deployment runs in a cloud sandbox that mounts this repo
# from GitHub, so the three artefacts the pricer loads have to be tracked.
# ~11 MB together; everything else under data/processed/ stays out.
!data/processed/matches.parquet
!data/processed/matches_with_holdout.parquet
!data/processed/calibration_maps.pkl
# --rehearse replays one cached 2024 match through the whole chain, and it
# merges the five market families back into a single record, so the fixture
# is a whole tournament's family set or nothing. Cincinnati is the smallest
# at ~1.2 MB. The other eleven tournaments stay out.
!data/processed/odds_portal/
data/processed/odds_portal/*
!data/processed/odds_portal/tennis_atp-cincinnati_2024_*.json
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
data/raw/mcp/*.csv

# Scratch run logs, never part of the record.
scratch_*.log

# Reconstructed local environment; requirements.txt is the record.
.venv/
.backtest_approved
.backtest_cache/
